                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "Set with a value outside 30.00 to 300.00 (350 here) sends nothing and keeps the keypad up: the range line under the field turns to the warning colour and becomes the sentence 'Enter a tempo from 30.00 to 300.00 BPM', wrapped in the left column, so the player sees why and can correct the figure without starting over. Set drops the value from its label when the entry is not a tempo it would send. A value below the range (3) is refused the same way."
              }
            ],
